kinds within Datastore,

00:32:04.420 --> 00:32:07.180
and then just put those
in a storage bucket.

00:32:07.180 --> 00:32:11.340
And from there, once you've got
that, it's relatively trivial

00:32:11.340 --> 00:32:14.330
to be able to point at that
Datastore backup inside Cloud

00:32:14.330 --> 00:32:16.941
Storage and say, hey, BigQuery
can you ingest this, please?

00:32:16.941 --> 00:32:18.690
One of the cool things
to note is that you

00:32:18.690 --> 00:32:20.765
can do scheduled backups.

00:32:20.765 --> 00:32:22.890
They are full backups,
